            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Nicolaus Copernicus</strong><br>\nNicolaus Copernicus was born on February 19, 1473, in the city of Torun, Poland. He came from a family that was part of the merchant class, with his father trading in copper. After his father's death, young Copernicus was raised by his uncle, who was a bishop and ensured he received a good education. This upbringing laid the foundation for Copernicus's interest in various scholarly pursuits, including the study of the heavens, known as astronomy.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Education in Italy</strong><br>\nCopernicus went to Italy to study at the University of Bologna in 1496. There, he learned about the laws of the universe and the theories of the planets and stars. His tutor, Domenico Maria de Novara, was an astronomer who influenced Copernicus's thinking about the Earth's position in the universe. Copernicus continued his studies in various fields, earning a doctorate in canon law from the University of Ferrara.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Canon and Medicine</strong><br>\nWhile studying law, Copernicus had not forgotten his passion for astronomy and continued to observe the skies. Besides his astronomical observations, he also worked as a canon, which is a type of priestly role, at the cathedral in Frauenburg. In addition to his ecclesiastical duties, Copernicus also practiced medicine, serving the community and the bishop's court.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
